[Audit] BenchmarkStart: name=controllable.dl, benchDir=synthesis-benchmark/controllable
[Audit] InputSpecFiles: schema=synthesis-benchmark/controllable/schema.dl, rules=synthesis-benchmark/controllable/rules.dl, properties=synthesis-benchmark/controllable/properties.dl
[Audit] ForbidConfig: global=<none>, perBenchmark=synthesis-benchmark/controllable/forbid.json
[Audit] LeakageCheck: synthesizer consumes specification + BMC counterexamples only; it does not load synthesized outputs as supervision labels.
[Audit] OutputTargets: datalogOut=synthesis-output/controllable.dl, stats=synthesis-output/synthesis_stats.csv
[controllable.dl] BenchmarkStart: program=Controllable, maxBound=5, maxIters=120, maxSolutionsPerStep=20
[controllable.dl] SeededPredicatesFromTxProperties: Map(controllerTransfer(s,r,n) :- recv_controllerTransfer(s,r,n). -> Set(Predicate(context: tx: recv_controllerTransfer(_,_,_), bindings: [controller(c), msgSender(s)], functor: s==c)), controllerRedeem(p,n) :- recv_controllerRedeem(p,n). -> Set(Predicate(context: tx: recv_controllerRedeem(p,n), bindings: [controller(c), msgSender(s)], functor: s==c)))
[controllable.dl] InitialTransactionRules:
controllerTransfer(s,r,n) :- recv_controllerTransfer(s,r,n),controller(c),msgSender(s),s==c.
transfer(s,r,n) :- recv_transfer(s,r,n).
mint(p,n) :- recv_mint(p,n).
controllerRedeem(p,n) :- recv_controllerRedeem(p,n),controller(c),msgSender(s),s==c.
burn(p,n) :- recv_burn(p,n).
increaseAllowance(o,s,d) :- recv_increaseAllowance(o,s,d).
transferFrom(o,r,s,n) :- recv_transferFrom(o,r,s,n).
